<!-- SEEZY Robot - Supermarket World Simulation                                          -->
<!-- =================================================================================== -->
<!-- This SDF file defines the Gazebo simulation environment for the SEEZY robot.        -->
<!-- It initializes the basic physics engine (ODE), lighting, gravity, and ground plane. -->
<!-- Note: Additional static models (shelves, walls, obstacles) can be inserted below.   -->
<!-- =================================================================================== -->
